WEBVTT

00:01:20.640 --> 00:01:21.730
<i>Every morning,</i>

00:01:23.890 --> 00:01:25.770
<i>over and over again,</i>

00:01:26.370 --> 00:01:28.370
<i>I sing and look over my shoulder.</i>

00:01:28.370 --> 00:01:29.800
<i>This is the sixth spring.</i>

00:01:41.450 --> 00:01:42.870
<i>My voice...</i>

00:01:45.520 --> 00:01:46.930
<i>still hasn't reached him.</i>

00:01:54.250 --> 00:02:00.010
♭01  We're Hiding How We Truly Feel

00:02:00.430 --> 00:02:03.620
Have you heard? In NO Hurry is disbanding.

00:02:03.620 --> 00:02:06.270
What? But I really liked <i>High School</i>.

00:02:04.850 --> 00:02:08.600
High School

00:02:12.710 --> 00:02:15.480
Playlist

00:02:15.610 --> 00:02:18.160
<i>Disbanding? In NO Hurry is?</i>

00:02:22.400 --> 00:02:26.320
<i>The new student orientation 
is about to begin.</i>

00:02:27.250 --> 00:02:30.000
Congratulations on Your Enrollment

00:02:27.500 --> 00:02:30.000
<i>There will be a performance on stage,</i>

00:02:30.330 --> 00:02:33.250
<i>so all first-years, please proceed to the gym.</i>

00:02:56.590 --> 00:02:57.960
Arisugawa?

00:02:59.290 --> 00:03:01.620
It really is you! Arisugawa Nino!

00:03:01.620 --> 00:03:03.190
It's me! You know, me!

00:03:04.520 --> 00:03:05.590
Is this a scam?

00:03:05.590 --> 00:03:08.660
We went to the same 
elementary school! I'm Mikota!

00:03:09.370 --> 00:03:10.660
Mikota?

00:03:10.660 --> 00:03:11.620
Graduation Album

00:03:13.290 --> 00:03:14.290
Arisugawa Nino

00:03:14.670 --> 00:03:16.050
Mikota Eiji

00:03:16.320 --> 00:03:17.450
Oh. Baldy, right?

00:03:17.450 --> 00:03:20.260
That was ages ago! 
I have tons of hair now!

00:03:20.510 --> 00:03:21.790
That's true.

00:03:21.790 --> 00:03:24.760
But really, I never thought we'd 
end up in the same high school.

00:03:24.760 --> 00:03:26.280
Have you made any friends?

00:03:26.280 --> 00:03:30.580
No. This is the first time I've opened 
my mouth since starting here.

00:03:30.580 --> 00:03:31.140
Huh?

00:03:31.520 --> 00:03:34.320
Everyone has left me alone since 
I've had my headphones on.

00:03:34.320 --> 00:03:36.350
You're the same as ever.

00:03:36.350 --> 00:03:37.140
Am I?

00:03:37.460 --> 00:03:38.840
Have you decided which club to join?

00:03:38.840 --> 00:03:39.780
The chorus club.

00:03:40.350 --> 00:03:42.990
So you're still singing, Arisugawa.

00:03:43.930 --> 00:03:44.550
Yeah.

00:03:47.120 --> 00:03:49.200
Looks like something's about to start.

00:03:49.200 --> 00:03:50.730
Oh, it's the light music club.

00:03:50.730 --> 00:03:52.080
Are they doing a concert?

00:03:54.530 --> 00:03:57.000
Hey, look. Isn't that guitarist super tiny?

00:03:57.000 --> 00:04:00.030
He really is! He makes the guitar look huge.

00:04:05.360 --> 00:04:06.090
<i>Huh?</i>

00:04:08.100 --> 00:04:09.880
Okay, may I have your attention?

00:04:10.440 --> 00:04:14.030
I'm the president of the light 
music club, Haruno Yoshito.

00:04:14.030 --> 00:04:15.810
Call me Haruyoshi.

00:04:16.320 --> 00:04:20.820
If you listen to one of our songs, 
I'll reward you with a hug.

00:04:22.600 --> 00:04:24.320
All right, let's go!

00:04:26.950 --> 00:04:28.850
Kuro! What are you doing?

00:04:29.660 --> 00:04:30.530
Huh?

00:04:32.260 --> 00:04:34.580
Oh! I got the songs mixed up!

00:04:34.580 --> 00:04:36.880
Come on! What're we gonna do now?

00:04:42.890 --> 00:04:45.250
Let's just go with it, Miou.

00:04:48.870 --> 00:04:51.520
<i>Empty words</i>

00:04:51.520 --> 00:04:53.560
<i>And conversations full of lies</i>

00:04:54.190 --> 00:04:56.270
<i>And scratches left on the desk</i>

00:04:56.270 --> 00:04:58.510
Isn't this an In NO Hurry cover?

00:04:56.860 --> 00:05:04.280
<i>Worn-out smiles, in the prison prepared 
by adults under the dark sky</i>

00:05:00.200 --> 00:05:01.650
It's <i>High School</i>!

00:05:03.050 --> 00:05:04.280
In NO Hurry?

00:05:04.830 --> 00:05:06.780
<i>When I stretch out my hand</i>

00:05:06.780 --> 00:05:09.530
<i>You slip and fall</i>

00:05:09.530 --> 00:05:12.460
<i>You wrench open your falling eyelids</i>

00:05:14.410 --> 00:05:17.900
<i>When I say, "Look at me"</i>

00:05:19.500 --> 00:05:22.190
<i>These unrequited feelings will never change</i>

00:05:21.890 --> 00:05:24.970
<i>What is this feeling? This song...</i>

00:05:22.190 --> 00:05:24.970
<i>The path we took can never be changed</i>

00:05:24.970 --> 00:05:27.470
<i>Just let everything go</i>

00:05:27.470 --> 00:05:29.450
<i>Far out into the sky</i>

00:05:29.450 --> 00:05:34.180
<i>Shout out! This song is 
the melody inside you</i>

00:05:34.180 --> 00:05:39.400
<i>Overflowing with all your 
love, wishes, and lies</i>

00:05:34.350 --> 00:05:38.380
<i>This song feels so good when I hear it live.</i>

00:05:39.410 --> 00:05:40.620
<i>Shout out!</i>

00:05:40.620 --> 00:05:44.650
<i>I'm hiding my heart by singing</i>

00:05:40.620 --> 00:05:44.650
I'm hiding my heart by singing.

00:05:44.650 --> 00:05:46.490
<i>Come to me</i>

00:05:46.490 --> 00:05:48.790
<i>Hear the sound of my heart</i>

00:05:46.490 --> 00:05:48.790
Hear the sound of my heart!

00:05:48.790 --> 00:05:51.580
<i>The words stuck in my throat and my eyes</i>

00:05:48.790 --> 00:05:51.580
The words stuck in my throat and my eyes!

00:05:51.580 --> 00:05:54.120
<i>The girl who's forever swimming</i>

00:05:51.580 --> 00:05:54.120
The girl who's forever swimming.

00:05:54.120 --> 00:05:55.660
<i>A lie that only I—</i>

00:05:54.120 --> 00:05:55.660
A lie that only I—

00:06:02.400 --> 00:06:03.500
Hey! What are you doing?

00:06:03.660 --> 00:06:04.890
Alice?

00:06:04.890 --> 00:06:05.450
Huh?

00:06:08.250 --> 00:06:09.430
Hey!

00:06:09.650 --> 00:06:10.360
What?

00:06:10.360 --> 00:06:11.930
What happened? Where's the rest?

00:06:22.560 --> 00:06:24.650
<i>Ever since that day six years ago,</i>

00:06:25.560 --> 00:06:27.910
<i>I sang with the belief that we'd meet again.</i>

00:06:29.340 --> 00:06:31.910
<i>The melody that you wrote 
down before disappearing...</i>

00:06:32.760 --> 00:06:34.960
<i>The tiny, yet enormous, promise...</i>

00:06:36.370 --> 00:06:37.500
<i>I found you.</i>

00:06:37.500 --> 00:06:38.610
<i>It reached you.</i>

00:06:38.610 --> 00:06:39.750
<i>It reached you!</i>

00:06:39.750 --> 00:06:41.250
<i>My voice reached you!</i>

00:06:42.020 --> 00:06:43.050
Yuzu!

00:06:51.680 --> 00:06:52.670
Ow!

00:06:52.670 --> 00:06:54.470
That hurt! What do you think you're doing?!

00:06:54.470 --> 00:06:57.060
Yuzu! You're Yuzu, right?! 
I found you! I found you!

00:06:57.060 --> 00:07:02.440
Yuzu! Yuzu! I found you! Yuzu, I found you! 
Yuzu, I found you! Yuzu! Yuzu! Yu—

00:06:57.970 --> 00:07:01.530
I see you still don't listen when 
people are talking to you, Alice.

00:07:02.890 --> 00:07:04.650
Huh? Yuzu, did you shrink?

00:07:05.440 --> 00:07:08.270
I grew! I'm 156 centimeters tall now!

00:07:08.270 --> 00:07:09.940
I'm 165.

00:07:10.690 --> 00:07:14.760
Oh, shut up. My growth spurt 
is only just beginning.

00:07:14.760 --> 00:07:16.870
I drink even more milk now than—

00:07:27.820 --> 00:07:29.520
Do you hear a voice 
coming from up there?

00:07:29.910 --> 00:07:32.080
More like a song.

00:07:38.930 --> 00:07:41.270
<i>Is it reaching you, Yuzu?</i>

00:07:42.270 --> 00:07:43.980
<i>The song you didn't get to hear back then.</i>

00:07:42.390 --> 00:07:43.600
Bye-bye, Alice

00:07:44.900 --> 00:07:46.560
<i>Your last melody.</i>

00:07:54.440 --> 00:07:55.260
Yuzu...

00:07:59.090 --> 00:08:00.120
I missed you.

00:08:09.600 --> 00:08:10.960
Yuzu...

00:08:20.020 --> 00:08:22.270
It looks like it's just your 
eyelashes that kept growing.

00:08:22.430 --> 00:08:24.740
Huh?! What do you mean, <i>just</i> my eyelashes?

00:08:24.740 --> 00:08:26.380
More importantly, could you move?

00:08:27.480 --> 00:08:28.170
Don't wanna.

00:08:28.170 --> 00:08:28.730
Huh?

00:08:29.180 --> 00:08:32.490
How come you suddenly 
stopped coming back then,

00:08:33.040 --> 00:08:33.990
Yuzu?

00:08:37.120 --> 00:08:38.920
It's none of your business.

00:08:38.920 --> 00:08:41.080
Don't talk to me anymore.

00:08:42.530 --> 00:08:43.470
Yuzu?

00:08:44.510 --> 00:08:46.290
Who's she?

00:08:47.650 --> 00:08:48.290
You...

00:08:48.960 --> 00:08:50.170
have very thick eyelashes.

00:08:50.170 --> 00:08:50.850
Huh?!

00:08:50.850 --> 00:08:51.760
Stupid Yuzu!

00:08:51.760 --> 00:08:53.130
Ouch! What's the idea?!

00:08:53.130 --> 00:08:55.240
That's what I want to know!

00:08:55.240 --> 00:08:56.850
Our concert was canceled because of you!

00:08:56.850 --> 00:08:58.720
Hurry up and come apologize with us!

00:08:59.610 --> 00:09:00.970
Wait, Yuzu!

00:09:01.210 --> 00:09:02.670
You won't disappear again, will you?

00:09:02.670 --> 00:09:04.460
Were you even listening?

00:09:05.270 --> 00:09:08.130
I told you not to talk to me anymore, Alice.

00:09:12.090 --> 00:09:15.230
I wonder if Yuzu's going 
through a rebellious stage.

00:09:17.780 --> 00:09:18.700
But...

00:09:18.990 --> 00:09:19.950
<i>I found him.</i>

00:09:21.720 --> 00:09:22.680
<i>I found him!</i>

00:09:23.560 --> 00:09:26.010
She's the Alice from Yuigahama?

00:09:26.010 --> 00:09:27.050
Yeah.

00:09:27.050 --> 00:09:28.080
Oh, dear.

00:09:28.080 --> 00:09:32.480
Yeah? I never knew Alice would be that cute!

00:09:32.480 --> 00:09:35.000
I should try to get on her good side.

00:09:35.000 --> 00:09:36.050
Kuro.

00:09:36.280 --> 00:09:38.020
Stop calling her that.

00:09:38.020 --> 00:09:40.650
I'm the only one who 
gets to call her Alice.

00:09:43.060 --> 00:09:45.190
Not that it really matters.

00:09:45.190 --> 00:09:46.690
Who cares about Alice, anyway?

00:09:46.690 --> 00:09:48.060
<i>Which is it?!</i>

00:09:48.750 --> 00:09:51.750
Why are you two laughing so hard?! 
Did I say something funny?!

00:09:52.660 --> 00:09:53.820
Well, more importantly...

00:09:54.360 --> 00:09:57.100
What we should be thinking about right now

00:09:57.100 --> 00:09:59.990
is how we're going to keep 
our club from being shut down.

00:10:00.310 --> 00:10:03.420
The orientation was a 
complete mess, after all.

00:10:03.420 --> 00:10:05.880
The student council said 
the club will be shut down

00:10:05.880 --> 00:10:07.320
if we cause any more problems.

00:10:07.320 --> 00:10:09.250
No way! They can't shut it down!

00:10:09.250 --> 00:10:11.290
We're the only members, too.

00:10:11.290 --> 00:10:12.420
Ah ha ha!

00:10:12.420 --> 00:10:14.050
Don't "Ah ha ha" me!

00:10:14.050 --> 00:10:15.460
What'll we do if we lose the—

00:10:15.460 --> 00:10:17.720
What's the problem? 
Let's just stop everything.

00:10:18.560 --> 00:10:21.180
After all, I can't write music anymore.

00:10:24.760 --> 00:10:27.810
Yuzu! The song that girl was singing...

00:10:28.120 --> 00:10:29.630
It's a melody you wrote, isn't it?

00:10:31.240 --> 00:10:32.200
And also...

00:10:33.530 --> 00:10:34.980
What was with her voice?

00:10:35.550 --> 00:10:36.320
Miou.

00:10:37.230 --> 00:10:39.530
That song's got nothing to do with me.

00:10:44.730 --> 00:10:49.870
Anyway, we have to make sure tomorrow's 
performance goes perfectly, Yuzu.

00:10:56.040 --> 00:10:59.170
I wonder when I'll be able to see Yuzu again.

00:10:59.610 --> 00:11:02.780
He's a year older than me, so he'll 
be in some second-year class...

00:11:03.800 --> 00:11:05.680
Milk

00:11:07.050 --> 00:11:08.810
Come on, take your seats.

00:11:09.130 --> 00:11:11.700
So you finally showed up, Yuzuriha Kanade.

00:11:11.990 --> 00:11:13.720
You're still tiny, even after being held back.

00:11:13.720 --> 00:11:15.440
Save your sympathy!

00:11:19.150 --> 00:11:20.260
Held back a year?

00:11:20.770 --> 00:11:23.120
Yuzuriha Kanade...

00:11:23.460 --> 00:11:25.280
So your name wasn't Yuzuda Yuzuo?

00:11:25.280 --> 00:11:28.100
Who's that supposed to be?
And don't talk to me.

00:11:28.460 --> 00:11:30.300
You drink milk from bigger cartons now.

00:11:30.300 --> 00:11:32.500
I told you not to talk to me!

00:11:33.180 --> 00:11:34.360
<i>He did.</i>

00:11:35.870 --> 00:11:36.750
<i>But...</i>

00:11:42.020 --> 00:11:45.320
<i>I'm happy we're in the same class.</i>

00:11:57.740 --> 00:12:01.220
<i>I hope that one day, I can be 
this close to Momo, too.</i>

00:12:05.640 --> 00:12:07.100
<i>I'm sure I'll find him one day.</i>

00:12:08.080 --> 00:12:12.080
Today: Welcoming of New Students
Students Dismissed After the Event

00:12:09.220 --> 00:12:12.080
<i>Today will be an event 
to welcome new students,</i>

00:12:12.080 --> 00:12:15.080
<i>and to introduce them to all our clubs.</i>

00:12:15.080 --> 00:12:18.530
<i>First-years, enjoy yourselves 
while you participate!</i>

00:12:16.090 --> 00:12:18.960
Welcoming of New Students
Schedule

00:12:16.780 --> 00:12:18.960
So the chorus club will be in the gym.

00:12:19.570 --> 00:12:21.310
Maybe I'll go see the light music club, too.

00:12:28.740 --> 00:12:31.350
<i>This sound... This piano!</i>

00:12:33.100 --> 00:12:35.840
<i>There's no doubt. It's...</i>

00:12:38.230 --> 00:12:39.290
<i>That song!</i>

00:13:17.520 --> 00:13:18.500
<i>It's the continuation!</i>

00:13:24.070 --> 00:13:25.740
<i>We're continuing from six years ago.</i>

00:13:29.520 --> 00:13:30.620
<i>It's coming together.</i>

00:13:35.160 --> 00:13:36.190
<i>Coming together!</i>

00:13:42.520 --> 00:13:43.630
<i>With back then!</i>

00:13:51.960 --> 00:13:52.910
You liar.

00:13:54.870 --> 00:13:55.950
It's time.

00:13:55.950 --> 00:13:57.260
For your concert?

00:13:57.260 --> 00:13:59.040
Do your best. I'll be watching.

00:14:04.110 --> 00:14:05.920
Miou is missing?!

00:14:05.920 --> 00:14:09.010
She left a message on my phone 
saying she won't be in the concert.

00:14:09.480 --> 00:14:11.050
She also turned her phone off.

00:14:11.050 --> 00:14:12.170
What the heck?

00:14:12.170 --> 00:14:14.450
If we don't have a vocalist, 
we'll be shut down for sure!

00:14:15.200 --> 00:14:16.830
Well, what can you do?

00:14:16.830 --> 00:14:17.460
No.

00:14:17.830 --> 00:14:21.750
I want to keep playing music with you 
guys, whatever form it may take.

00:14:28.050 --> 00:14:29.170
Arisugawa Nino.

00:14:29.560 --> 00:14:30.590
I hate to say it,

00:14:31.180 --> 00:14:32.800
but you're our only option.

00:14:36.150 --> 00:14:37.000
Why?

00:14:37.670 --> 00:14:38.640
Why?

00:14:38.970 --> 00:14:39.890
Why?

00:14:42.110 --> 00:14:44.790
Why is it pouring out of me like this?

00:14:45.280 --> 00:14:47.610
Who wrote that piano piece?

00:14:48.200 --> 00:14:50.160
I did. What about it?

00:14:50.160 --> 00:14:51.530
My hands are full right now.

00:14:52.070 --> 00:14:53.450
You're in the light music club, right?

00:14:53.640 --> 00:14:57.030
I am. We're having a concert soon. 
Why don't you watch it?

00:14:57.030 --> 00:14:59.310
Light viewing of a light music club.

00:15:00.140 --> 00:15:02.700
Jeez, what's your deal?! Who are you?

00:15:02.700 --> 00:15:03.460
Me?

00:15:04.420 --> 00:15:07.200
I'm from Class 1-S. My name's Sakaki.

00:15:07.540 --> 00:15:08.220
You?

00:15:08.410 --> 00:15:11.220
I'm in Class 1-A. Yuzuriha.

00:15:12.520 --> 00:15:13.850
What a weird name.

00:15:14.810 --> 00:15:16.140
Are you composing?

00:15:16.140 --> 00:15:18.140
What if I am? Don't look.

00:15:19.350 --> 00:15:22.420
This is the first time I've seen 
someone other than myself compose.

00:15:22.960 --> 00:15:24.540
Sorry for interrupting, Eyelashes.

00:15:24.540 --> 00:15:26.530
Don't call me Eyelashes! 
I told you my name!

00:15:28.030 --> 00:15:29.460
Sorry. Eye mixed them up.

00:15:29.460 --> 00:15:31.530
I get it. Just come to our concert.

00:15:31.850 --> 00:15:33.070
What a weirdo.

00:15:36.720 --> 00:15:37.540
Huh?!

00:15:37.540 --> 00:15:40.930
The light music club... 
So basically, an amateur concert?

00:15:41.990 --> 00:15:44.020
<i>Next, we have the chorus club.</i>

00:15:45.270 --> 00:15:47.330
The chorus club is already starting.

00:15:47.330 --> 00:15:48.710
We're running out of time.

00:15:48.710 --> 00:15:51.540
I guess it's impossible to memorize 
two songs before the concert.

00:15:51.540 --> 00:15:52.950
How about we go with one—

00:15:52.150 --> 00:15:53.970
I've got the score, so I'll be fine.

00:15:54.970 --> 00:15:56.170
<i>This is Yuzu's music.</i>

00:15:57.950 --> 00:16:00.180
<i>I get to sing the melody that Yuzu composed.</i>

00:16:21.580 --> 00:16:23.290
<i>It's resonating through my body.</i>

00:16:24.130 --> 00:16:26.270
<i>This is definitely Yuzu's melody.</i>

00:16:27.630 --> 00:16:31.170
<i>And yet, both the sound and the 
rhythm are a Yuzu I don't know.</i>

00:16:31.410 --> 00:16:32.500
Hey!

00:16:32.500 --> 00:16:35.300
Alice is filling in for Miou on vocals? 
What's going on here?

00:16:35.300 --> 00:16:37.000
I've learned the songs.

00:16:37.000 --> 00:16:38.930
You're really going to sing, Alice?

00:16:38.930 --> 00:16:41.990
You told me not to talk to you, 
so why are you talking to me?

00:16:42.240 --> 00:16:43.960
Jeez, just forget about that!

00:16:44.540 --> 00:16:46.710
So, what's the deal? Are you going to sing?

00:16:47.270 --> 00:16:48.230
I will.

00:16:49.720 --> 00:16:50.730
That so?

00:16:51.570 --> 00:16:53.150
Then have it your way.

00:16:54.260 --> 00:16:55.580
No need to tell me.

00:16:56.660 --> 00:17:00.250
Light music club, please start setting up.

00:17:00.600 --> 00:17:02.330
Then that settles it.

00:17:02.860 --> 00:17:09.670
<i>Twinkle, twinkle, little star</i>

00:17:08.380 --> 00:17:09.430
Are you okay?

00:17:09.670 --> 00:17:16.670
<i>How I wonder what you are</i>

00:17:09.960 --> 00:17:10.750
Yeah.

00:17:16.670 --> 00:17:23.310
<i>Up above the world so high</i>

00:17:16.680 --> 00:17:17.960
<i>It's been six years.</i>

00:17:19.980 --> 00:17:22.240
<i>It's the song I could never stand to listen to.</i>

00:17:23.510 --> 00:17:30.370
<i>Like a diamond in the sky</i>

00:17:30.730 --> 00:17:37.210
<i>Twinkle, twinkle, little star</i>

00:17:37.670 --> 00:17:45.050
<i>How I wonder what you are</i>

00:17:46.580 --> 00:17:47.580
Momo!

00:17:51.130 --> 00:17:52.210
Mom?

00:17:53.190 --> 00:17:56.470
Nino, Momo-kun moved away.

00:17:57.100 --> 00:17:58.130
Momo...

00:18:06.910 --> 00:18:07.930
<i>I have to sing.</i>

00:18:11.980 --> 00:18:13.110
<i>I have to sing.</i>

00:18:16.350 --> 00:18:17.090
<i>I can't!</i>

00:18:19.550 --> 00:18:20.620
<i>I have to sing!</i>

00:18:21.140 --> 00:18:23.050
If we can't see each other anymore...

00:18:24.500 --> 00:18:27.210
I hope, one day, we can 
use your song as a guide

00:18:28.350 --> 00:18:30.130
to find each other again.

00:18:30.440 --> 00:18:31.630
Alice...

00:18:31.860 --> 00:18:34.140
<i>Rebel with your voice</i>

00:18:34.140 --> 00:18:36.630
<i>Against this hoarse spiral!</i>

00:18:37.820 --> 00:18:38.630
Wait...

00:18:39.710 --> 00:18:40.590
Match her!

00:18:40.870 --> 00:18:42.100
Got it!

00:18:42.100 --> 00:18:46.780
<i>With my sound that's been held 
back against this twisted horizon</i>

00:18:47.310 --> 00:18:51.710
<i>Rend with your voice 
this coil that only grows worse</i>

00:18:52.400 --> 00:18:56.980
<i>I sing a song with this 
crumbling musical staff</i>

00:18:52.940 --> 00:18:54.610
What's with that voice?

00:18:54.610 --> 00:18:56.840
They've got a different vocalist.

00:18:56.840 --> 00:18:57.820
Amazing...

00:18:57.820 --> 00:19:02.120
<i>And we crumble away into small pieces</i>

00:19:07.120 --> 00:19:12.210
<i>The morning and dead of the night 
loop back onto themselves</i>

00:19:12.210 --> 00:19:17.550
<i>I idly bite down while I 
murmur and close my eyes</i>

00:19:14.780 --> 00:19:18.050
<i>She's so rough around the edges. 
It makes it hard to keep up!</i>

00:19:18.060 --> 00:19:23.280
<i>I never had anything to 
share from the beginning</i>

00:19:21.920 --> 00:19:24.060
<i>She has no intention of matching any of us.</i>

00:19:23.280 --> 00:19:28.600
<i>I come to you barefoot 
to extend a hand to you</i>

00:19:24.060 --> 00:19:27.980
<i>She's like a canary that's been kept 
caged its whole life, going berserk.</i>

00:19:28.600 --> 00:19:33.350
<i>Simply rebel with your voice 
against this hoarse spiral</i>

00:19:33.800 --> 00:19:38.450
<i>With my sound that's been held 
back against this twisted horizon</i>

00:19:34.570 --> 00:19:37.320
Amazing. Just what is she?

00:19:37.320 --> 00:19:39.190
I can't stop getting goosebumps.

00:19:39.190 --> 00:19:43.750
<i>Rend with your voice 
this crumbling musical staff</i>

00:19:39.960 --> 00:19:41.160
<i>I can't stop.</i>

00:19:44.370 --> 00:19:48.740
<i>Fly free, winding around our world</i>

00:19:46.690 --> 00:19:47.750
<i>Momo.</i>

00:19:48.740 --> 00:19:49.900
<i>Momo!</i>

00:19:52.430 --> 00:19:53.080
Yes.

00:19:54.060 --> 00:19:55.970
Yes, it's going okay.

00:19:55.970 --> 00:19:58.210
I hear something wild's 
going on in the gym!

00:19:58.210 --> 00:20:00.070
It's the light music concert, right?

00:20:00.070 --> 00:20:02.050
Yes, I understand that.

00:20:02.050 --> 00:20:05.950
<i>The dark gray wiring overhead shakes</i>

00:20:05.950 --> 00:20:12.550
<i>I run from the night sky, 
where you're nowhere to be found</i>

00:20:13.150 --> 00:20:16.020
<i>To the wide open sky 
I see beyond the window</i>

00:20:16.020 --> 00:20:18.980
<i>Where should I run to?</i>

00:20:18.980 --> 00:20:20.740
<i>Save me</i>

00:20:20.740 --> 00:20:23.160
<i>The words overflowing from me are ash</i>

00:20:23.160 --> 00:20:25.740
<i>Thrown out without ever being found</i>

00:20:24.080 --> 00:20:25.740
<i>Stop me!</i>

00:20:37.070 --> 00:20:38.080
<i>It's happening again.</i>

00:20:38.390 --> 00:20:42.680
<i>I'm filled with such jealousy, 
longing, and possessiveness</i>

00:20:43.190 --> 00:20:45.390
<i>that I feel like my body will be torn apart.</i>

00:20:47.980 --> 00:20:49.550
<i>I'm going to be crushed</i>

00:20:50.560 --> 00:20:52.110
<i>Watch me</i>

00:20:53.140 --> 00:20:54.650
<i>I'm a mess</i>

00:20:56.860 --> 00:20:59.570
<i>Just like that promise</i>

00:21:01.210 --> 00:21:02.060
<i>Momo...</i>

00:21:07.550 --> 00:21:08.560
<i>Alice...</i>

00:21:10.200 --> 00:21:14.440
<i>Just make tomorrow disappear</i>

00:21:10.670 --> 00:21:12.140
<i>This voice will...</i>

00:21:13.490 --> 00:21:15.120
<i>My voice will...</i>

00:21:15.310 --> 00:21:17.710
<i>All I want is one thing</i>

00:21:16.020 --> 00:21:17.020
<i>Forever...</i>

00:21:17.710 --> 00:21:19.540
<i>Just one thing</i>

00:21:17.920 --> 00:21:19.840
<i>...belong to me and only me.</i>

00:21:17.920 --> 00:21:19.840
<i>...belong to Momo and only Momo.</i>

00:21:20.300 --> 00:21:24.850
<i>Rebel with your voice 
against this hoarse spiral</i>

00:21:25.420 --> 00:21:29.860
<i>With my sound that's been held 
back against this twisted horizon</i>

00:21:30.600 --> 00:21:35.310
<i>Rend with your voice 
this crumbling musical staff</i>

00:21:35.770 --> 00:21:39.820
<i>And we crumble away into small pieces</i>

00:21:37.090 --> 00:21:38.030
<i>Momo!</i>

00:21:39.130 --> 00:21:40.330
<i>Momo!</i>

00:21:41.320 --> 00:21:42.130
Nino?

00:21:46.010 --> 00:21:48.570
<i>I'm sure I heard him just now.</i>

00:21:47.680 --> 00:21:48.570
Alice?!

00:21:48.570 --> 00:21:49.490
Huh? What?

00:21:48.570 --> 00:21:49.980
Alice! Alice!

00:21:49.490 --> 00:21:51.180
Did she forget the lyrics?

00:21:49.980 --> 00:21:51.830
There's no fixing this. End it!

00:21:51.830 --> 00:21:52.580
Roger!

00:21:55.710 --> 00:21:56.540
That was...

00:21:58.130 --> 00:21:59.370
Momo's voice.

00:22:02.650 --> 00:22:06.030
<i>Momo? Are you listening? 
Today's the deadline.</i>

00:22:06.030 --> 00:22:06.810
<i>Momo?</i>

00:22:11.540 --> 00:22:16.490
<i>We're hiding how we truly feel.</i>

00:23:47.210 --> 00:23:52.140
♭02
God, I Pray That Alice's Love Will Never Be Realized
